{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2023-03-15 13:30:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN REACHES PAID SICK LEAVE AGREEMENT WITH ADDITIONAL MECHANICAL RAILROADERS', 'text': "NINE NORFOLK SOUTHERN UNIONS NOW HAVE ACCESS TO PAID SICK LEAVE BENEFITS ATLANTA , MARCH 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) ANNOUNCED WEDNESDAY THAT IT HAS REACHED AN AGREEMENT WITH ANOTHER OF ITS LABOR UNIONS TO PROVIDE UP TO SEVEN PAID SICK DAYS PER YEAR TO THEIR MEMBERS. THE AGREEMENT, REACHED IN COLLABORATION WITH THE INTERNATIONAL BROTHERHOOD OF BOILERMAKERS AND BLACKSMITHS (IBBB), WILL IMMEDIATELY PROVIDE NORFOLK SOUTHERN'S MECHANICAL RAILROADERS WITH FOUR NEW DAYS OF PAID SICK LEAVE PER YEAR WHILE ALSO OFFERING THEM THE FLEXIBILITY TO USE UP TO THREE ADDITIONAL DAYS OF EXISTING PAID TIME OFF AS SICK LEAVE."}